    "content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Updated schedule for Wednesday:<ul><li>10:00 Coding (Harper)</li><li>11:00 System design (Alex)</li><li>13:00 Hiring manager (Parker)</li></ul></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Calendar invites go out Monday morning. The candidate packet is in the hiring folder.</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Blake</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Harper Hale &lt;harper.hale@example.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, October 13, 2026 7:30 AM<br><b>To:</b> Blake Brook &lt;blake.brook@example.com&gt;; Alex Example &lt;you@example.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> RE: Interview loop: Senior Backend Engineer</font><div>&nbsp;</div></div><div>I can do the coding session, but 11:00 clashes with the architecture review.</div><div><br></div><div>Could we swap, so I go first at 10:00 and Alex takes 11:00?</div><div><br></div><div>Harper</div><div><br></div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On 12 Oct 2026, at 15:00, Blake Brook &lt;blake.brook@example.com&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Hi Alex and Harper,</div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">We have a strong candidate for the Senior Backend Engineer role coming on site next week. Proposed loop for <b>Wednesday, October 21</b>:<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Time</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Session</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\" align=\"left\">Interviewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">10:00&ndash;10:45</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">System design</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Alex</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">11:00&ndash;11:45</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Coding</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Harper</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">13:00&ndash;13:30</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Hiring manager</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 6px\">Parker</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Can you both confirm? Scorecards are due within 24 hours of the interview: <a href=\"https://example.com/hiring/scorecards\">https://example.com/hiring/scorecards</a></div><div><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Thanks,<br>Blake</div></div></blockquote></div></body></html>"
